   "pending": [
    "M2030 is now received and reviewed: the 20-in gas continuations join the 24-in V-1040 line; the separate 4-in circuit continues to F-1050/F-1055. Precise package/nozzle correspondence, the separate 20-in hydraulic equalization route, and M2040/M2050 interfaces remain pending. Existing main destinations are preserved.",
    "The source separates the 20-in main liquid continuation and the 4-in auxiliary circuit. Existing main liquid piping was not assigned a guessed size or rerouted.",
    "V-035 / V-036 physical routing and check-flow orientation remain pending; no new bypass or check-valve location is invented.",
    "Sub-inch instrument roots, vents and drains are source-only; no fitting-by-fitting tubing is required. Unreadable specification characters must be checked against the original.",
    "The upper separator chambers are represented by the existing simplified V-1025 assembly. Compact accessory locations are not field coordinates.",
    "No separately tagged PSV or regulator is identified on this sheet; no extra relief device or setting is added.",
    "Dark green denotes operator-requested raw inlet gas / condensate (raw NGL color convention), not verified liquid-only composition."
   ],
