     "text": "XV-1040A is 24 in, FC. Separate 2 in equalizing/bypass leg contains 204001 B8RF-H2 CSO and 204002 B4R-H2. PIT-1040B is upstream and PIT-1040A downstream; PDI-1040A / XS-1040A are DCS differential/open-permissive functions, not extra pressure bodies. ZSC/ZSO-1040A and XXY-1040A are valve feedback/solenoid relationships. No numerical differential permissive is stated here.",
