     "text": "PSV-1040: 1.5 in Class 300 inlet x 3 in Class 150 outlet, G orifice, SET 715 PSIG FIRE. Branch 1409-2 in-RF-B1-CS takes pressure from the inlet downstream of XV-1040A; CSO inlet block 204010, 2 x 1.5 reducer. Outlet expands 3 x 4 through CSO block 204012 to 1014-4 in-RF-A0-CS and M2902. Separate 2 in vent/bypass has CSC block 204014 and valve 204013. Relief setting is reference information, not permission to isolate protection.",
