     "text": "V-1040 liquid outlet: 1015-3 in-DH-B1-CS-1.5 inHU-ETW -> XV-1040B (3 in FC) -> manual 204025 -> temporary strainer SP-2040A -> 3 x 1 reducer -> LV-1040A (1 in FC; existing simulator name LCV-1040A) -> 1 x 3 expansion -> check 204027 -> manual 204029 -> 1016-3 in-DH-D1-CS-1.5 inHU-ETW -> closed drain M2960. Separate 2 in bypass via 204031 CSC and 204030 rejoins downstream. B1/D1 specification break is shown at the control-valve assembly.",
