     "id": "pump_P-5060",
     "tags": [
      "P-5060"
     ],
     "text": "P-5060 is an individual stabilizer booster pump: SERO PUMPS, model SRZS 665 US W G16V-HKT.62; ANSI CENTRIFUGAL; 123 GPM; TDH TBD; driver 50 HP / 460 VAC / 3PH; 1775 RPM; frame 326T; weight 1600 LBS. These are drawing design data, not a field nameplate or live reading.",
     "location": "Separate P-5060 equipment heading and vendor pump branch",
